{"job_id":"F-2845c90deeeb1ab78515","family_id":"F-2845c90deeeb1ab78515","title":"베트남산 합판에 대한 덤핑방지관세 부과에 관한 규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014687-263817-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":28,"target_id":"def9b75f1034cccc8c86a0cf48ceee2e84cd448ef2a5b4679f419a7f1150dae0","source_hash":"5c6c5b0ea47ba9bb78c1120d630b22d6e2d82ae1d5be40ab5ac6686ec4a469ca","text":"关于对越南胶合板征收反倾销税的规定"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014687-263817-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":86,"target_id":"125f1a9008d86bf2f1d85cdf4d53b723a320a9ac531823ea9754071948ea9071","source_hash":"1a2180cc6d0a23473176e09b095aee2b985442fe6d501f1561d90af9fc54684e","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是根据《海关法》第五十一条指定应缴纳反倾销税的商品和供应商，并规定适用于该等商品的关税税率。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014687-263817-ko","scope":"BODY","start":86,"end":285,"target_id":"0b528bb9eb6f3a26bb64d57812a0dd45dcb9367fdd122b34c56dd91934176b5e","source_hash":"1269ad815de9fd5753d1bb2b2d2052570202e82aaedcbdfe4bad844cde3ddaf5","text":"第二条（征税对象） 应征收反倾销税的货物为越南产胶合板（指根据《海关法实施令》第98条第1款，海关和统计协调制度税号4412.31、4412.33、4412.34、4412.39、4412.91、4412.92或4412.99项下对应的胶合板），厚度为6毫米（mm）以上。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014687-263817-ko","scope":"BODY","start":285,"end":360,"target_id":"3b2f00f0de6a9ed62599ad02b0e6cdb538b985a7e9f975d8f924dd98c8ea3034","source_hash":"2a9a883534d346b34789a4e35bdba50415b359f2b1157b2c69b6940aa7b3ebdb","text":"第三条（受征税货物的供应商和反倾销税税率）根据第二条规定受征税货物的供应商以及各供应商的反倾销税税率如下表所示。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014687-263817-ko","scope":"BODY","start":360,"end":382,"target_id":"cb6934452da67096ef02b0276d414cf02c84da531350a87d205ef371386c8655","source_hash":"1c23604c1a1e79a872df8b7f559272b533fee4fc9f7ec5d203c14ae011044dda","text":"补充规定 <第1076号，2024年7月2日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014687-263817-ko","scope":"BODY","start":382,"end":412,"target_id":"8d1c45cb094e44c75a053058ad95c377e27dbc842c75a5cdf775812795591229","source_hash":"0d63a18201aaf2f1d98d1a1c71f36ac02913f4fc2004246a24afe6bdd25c6c45","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014687-263817-ko","scope":"BODY","start":412,"end":450,"target_id":"d2536616ec7f2e0f9a57164b937ae3bf798ab89aa5f2573b11d30bb54a85d6aa","source_hash":"183d72790e621b013e8abef61a83e88b16c9786072b353343cb89f76f2b1daf3","text":"第二条（有效期）本规则自公布之日起有效期为五年。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014687-263817-ko","scope":"BODY","start":450,"end":2196,"target_id":"fa4f7165ed068795df77b2a4cb07afe9ed22acb94de322ef0eeb2d55012aebaf","source_hash":"bdaf4b5683834b09377e644c6f140e6941be6ee793d9a4650c10cecb23a7a9c2","text":"第 3 条（适用于复审期间受反倾销措施约束的货物）本规则适用于 2023 年 11 月 6 日或之后申报进口的货物。\n\n供应商对受反倾销税征收的货物征收的反倾销税税率（与第3条相关）\n■ 对越南胶合板征收反倾销税的规则 [附表] \n\n  供应商对受征税货物的反倾销税税率（与第3条相关）                           \n\n┌───┬─────────────────────────┬────────┐\n\n│供应国│供应商│反倾销│\n\n│ │ │关税率(%) │\n\n├───┼─────────────────────────┼────────┤\n\n│越南│1. Savi（SAVI CO. LTD）及其产品出口│23.74 │\n\n│      │는 자                                             │                │\n\n│      ├─────────────────────────┼────────┤\n\n│ │2. Thanh Hung Import-Export Company Limited │9.80 │\n\n│ │以及出口公司产品的人员 │ │\n\n│      ├─────────────────────────┼────────┤\n\nMTQ1dfaaa48afc30e0a00286开始│ │3. Junma Phu Tho（Junma Phu Tho Company Limited）和 │31.28 │\n\n│ │公司产品出口人 │ │\n\n│      ├─────────────────────────┼────────┤\n\nMTQ1dfaaa48afc30e0a00288开始│ │4. Kiuti Courser (Cong Ty Tnhh Mot Thanh Vien Kieu │31.28 │\n\n│ │Thi Junma) 以及出口该公司产品的公司 │ │\n\n│      ├─────────────────────────┼────────┤\n\n│ │5. 燕柏木业有限公司 │9.78 │\n\n│ │ 以及出口公司产品的人员 │ │\n\n│      ├─────────────────────────┼────────┤\n\n│ │6. 荣嘉木业越南有限公司 │31.28 │\n\n│ │ 以及出口公司产品的人员 │ │\n\n│      ├─────────────────────────┼────────┤\n\n│ │7. 下列各款所列公司及其产品出口商 │11.46 │\n\n│ │Ja │ │\n\n│ │ A. TTTK（TTTK有限公司） │ │\n\n"},{"id":"A39691-zh-00001","doc":"A39691","law_id":"kr-014687-263817-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML